====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{senseid|en|gift}} A [[gift]], especially one given for birthdays, Christmas, anniversaries, graduations, weddings, or any other special occasions.
#: {{coi|en|[[wedding]] '''present'''}}; &emsp; {{coi|en|[[birthday]] '''present'''}}
#: {{ux|en|Oh! Thank you for the '''presents'''! How [[considerate]] of you!}}
#: {{ux|en|Only his friends attended his birthday party. They're all [[broke]], so he got no '''present'''.}}
#* {{RQ:Maxwell Mirror and the Lamp|chapter=7|passage=“A very welcome, kind, useful '''present''', that means to the parish. By the way, Hopkins, let this go no further. We don't want the tale running round that a rich person has arrived. Churchill, my dear fellow, we have such greedy sharks, and wolves in lamb's clothing.{{nb...}}”}}
# {{lb|en|military}} The position of a [[soldier]] in [[present arms|presenting arms]].
#: {{ux|en|The [[platoon]] stands at '''present'''.}}
#: {{ux|en|He was at '''present''' near the headquarters gates.}}
# {{lb|en|colloquial|euphemistic|affectionate}} [[poo|Poo]]; [[feces]].
#: {{ux|en|I think our toddler's just left us a little '''present''' in his diaper...}}
#: {{ux|en|She has to deal with her cats' '''presents''' in the litterboxes on a daily basis, and she doesn't mind [[not one bit|one bit]].}}

